      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-solution strengthening from Al will help preserve or improve high-temperature strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing 5–15 at% Hf with Al is predicted to decrease density by 5–10% relative to as-cast HfMoTaTiZr.",
